  Here five invariant factors of $B$ equal $3$, the last equals $12$, and the first seven equal $1$.
  So, for $z=\left(z_1,\dots,z_{13}\right)\in\Z^{1\times [3]_3}$ we have  $z\in M:=\left\{x^\top B\,:\, x\in \Z^{[3]_3}\right\}$ iff
  {\footnotesize\begin{eqnarray*}
    2z_2+z_3+z_4+2z_6+2z_7+z_8 & \equiv& 0\pmod 3,\\
    z_1+2z_2+z_5+2z_6+2z_7+z_9 & \equiv& 0\pmod 3,\\
