\begin{example}
  Let $C$ be the $\Z_3$-code of the incidence matrix between lines and points in $\PG(2,3)$ and $B$ as in Example~\ref{example_incidences_lines_points_pg_2_3}. Generator matrices
  of $C$ and its dual code $C^\perp$ are e.g.\ given by
