  respectively. Clearly, we have $\dim(C)+\dim(C^\perp)=[3]_3=13$ since $C$ and $C^\perp$ are vector spaces. Now consider
  the incidence matrix
  $$
  B'=
  {\tiny\arraycolsep=0.3\arraycolsep\ensuremath{\left(\begin{array}{rrrrrrrrrrrrr}
  0 & 1 & 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\
